{"type":"standard","title":"Andrea Salinas","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Andrea Salinas</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q39791512","titles":{"canonical":"Andrea_Salinas","normalized":"Andrea Salinas","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Andrea Salinas</span></span>"},"pageid":55238569,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Andrea_Salinas%2C_Official_Portrait%2C_118th_Congress.jpg/330px-Andrea_Salinas%2C_Official_Portrait%2C_118th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/33/Andrea_Salinas%2C_Official_Portrait%2C_118th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3360,"height":4200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1376742403","tid":"0fd72858-b940-11f1-a7a3-42dd7d8ac8e2","timestamp":"2026-09-26T00:20:22Z","description":"American politician (born 1969)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrea_Salinas","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrea_Salinas?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrea_Salinas?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Andrea_Salinas"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrea_Salinas","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Andrea_Salinas","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrea_Salinas?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Andrea_Salinas"}},"extract":"Andrea Rose Salinas is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative for Oregon's 6th congressional district since 2023. Oregon's 6th congressional district includes all of Yamhill and Polk counties, the part of Marion County that includes Salem and Woodburn, a small piece of Beaverton, and the suburban communities to the southwest of Portland, including Tigard, Tualatin, and Sherwood.","extract_html":"<p><b>Andrea Rose Salinas</b> is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative for Oregon's 6th congressional district since 2023. Oregon's 6th congressional district includes all of Yamhill and Polk counties, the part of Marion County that includes Salem and Woodburn, a small piece of Beaverton, and the suburban communities to the southwest of Portland, including Tigard, Tualatin, and Sherwood.</p>"}